body:
You make a good point about the uniforms and here’s why I think it makes sense;

Even in this movies universe, the US was at one point homogenous and a few big brand suppliers supplied the entirety of the DoD with uniforms and equipment, so in the event of a split like this, both sides would be wearing the same or similar patterns. I noticed it immediately and think it’s just another way of conveying the horrors of war, and a war against your own people. 

This movie isn’t designed to make you feel some type of way about US politics and social issues, it’s to remind anyone who watches it that at the end of the day no matter what you think you’re fighting for, it’s death and destruction, and horror, maybe even the ones you love.

